{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3fd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa46-d728-77c2-9a0a-18bc71689023"},"sequence":89,"recorded_at":1780531400000173,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba"},"call_id":"call_01a0aa471775749d90ef9b2a58bfd656","text":"Read text file `.temp/resources/TASK-260916-3p5y8l/TASK-260916-3p5y8l_publish-brief.md`.\n1|# Publish accepted native toolchain alignment\n2|\n3|Muse Spark1.3 max only after BUG-260916-1rqn1c latest CR has independent Astra ACCEPT. Read exact final review verdict, acceptance identity and prospective PR tree; if not accepted do not publish. Use operational TASK_BOARD_CONFIG=/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/.temp/resume-20260916/task-board.config.json through curator task-board. Preserve all root dirty board, LOGBOOK patch/stash and managed refs. Do not write root LOGBOOK; outcome replaces it for this run.\n4|\n5|PR6 https://github.com/relux-works/relux-tunnel/pull/6 branch delivery/STORY-260715-1y04r0-rev3 expected input d45c85d67b78b6578b5cb0821bd2e78217124d30. Create isolated task-scoped delivery worktree from freshly verified remote feature head. Verify remote default authority fresh too. Only compose the exact independently accepted new delta (expected five paths including ci.yml, select-native-xcode.sh and three tests; current reviewer may change this). Never copy candidate wholesale: it contains old board state and prerequisite stack. Verify staged tree equals reviewer prospective tree and every unrelated PR entry remains identical. If remote input differs or review is incomplete, preserve evidence and route to parent, do not guess.\n6|\n7|Use Ivan Oparin <oparin@me.com>, signing key /Users/iv/.ssh/ivanopcode, explicit git commit -S, current timestamps. Verify every new commit locally and GitHub, preserve prior signed objects, plain feature fast-forward push no force. Do not modify rootmain/localmanagedrefs. Update PR description if needed to describe final scope and include delivered BUG IDs accurately; do not remove existing historical content needlessly. No actual main landing in this task. Parent routes exact-head platform review and landing after legitimate green checks.\n8|\n9|Observe exact-head hosted CI to terminal real outcomes, capture perjob results and useful full failing diagnostics/toolchain if red. A real observed red is a valid completed publication observation task; green is NOT a prerequisite for your handoff. No synthetic statuses or unchecked scope changes; new defect goes to parent. Do not run redundant full local suites: reuse accepted exact-candidate gate plus treeidentity, then real hosted run. Preserve active accepted source worktree cache, all evidence and unlanded changes. No VPN, no global Xcode changes on this machine, no nestedworkers/tooling/source edits. Complete checklist truthfully, attach task-scoped result and handoff.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3ff","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa46-d728-77c2-9a0a-18bc71689023"},"sequence":90,"recorded_at":1780531400000175,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba"},"call_id":"call_01a0aa47199070edab2f4f6ead9fdc38","text":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-3-1\",\n  \"command\": \"echo \\\"RUN_ID=${TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID:-unset}\\\"; pwd; git status --porcelain=v1 -b | head -n 50; git log --oneline -15; git log --show-signature -3 --format='%H %G? %GS %an %s' | head -n 20\\nls -la .task-board/ 2>&1 | head -n 30\",\n  \"description\": \"Inspect git state and run id\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"RUN_ID=RUN-260916-6faeb4\\n/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel\\n## main...origin/main [ahead 2]\\n M .task-board/.activity/STORY-260715-1y04r0/events.ndjson\\n M .task-board/.activity/TASK-260830-1x524u/events.ndjson\\n M .task-board/.goals/primary/head.json\\n M .task-board/.goals/v2/owners/parent/primary/head.json\\n M .task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-whtdsf/TASK-260715-whtdsf_ci-trust-boundary.puml\\n M .task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-1x524u/TASK-260830-1x524u_spawn-log_-tester--tester--codex-_RUN-260907-765f2f.log\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-21g2pi_product-experience-and-security/STORY-260715-309t4z_connection-control-and-status-ui/TASK-260715-2a1cp7_record-connection-presentation-state-and-command-contract/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-21g2pi_product-experience-and-security/STORY-260715-tx1tbz_profile-and-key-management/TASK-260721-2raag7_add-explicit-exit-resolver-profile-experience/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/STORY-260715-2ungml_capability-and-degraded-mode/TASK-260715-1vg1mb_add-capability-state-and-fault-injection-tests/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/STORY-260715-2ungml_capability-and-degraded-mode/TASK-260715-2y78ah_add-degraded-routing-dns-leak-integration-tests/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/STORY-260715-2ungml_capability-and-degraded-mode/TASK-260715-2zmw58_record-degraded-safe-dns-fallback-policy/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/STORY-260715-2ungml_capability-and-degraded-mode/TASK-260715-3260rm_integrate-selected-degraded-safe-dns-transport/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/STORY-260715-2ungml_capability-and-degraded-mode/TASK-260715-3kga9i_document-capability-modes-limitations-and-diagnostics/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/STORY-260715-2ungml_capability-and-degraded-mode/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_viability-and-foundation/STORY-260715-l2i2oo_target-project-architecture/TASK-260715-nphtib_execute-generated-project-architecture-verification/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_viability-and-foundation/STORY-260715-l2i2oo_target-project-architecture/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_viability-and-foundation/STORY-260715-lkshfz_ssh-engine-spike/TASK-260715-1af33i_integrate-reluxniossh-candidate-adapter/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_viability-and-foundation/STORY-260715-lkshfz_ssh-engine-spike/TASK-260715-3ikonq_run-reluxniossh-functional-and-rekey-matrix/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_viability-and-foundation/STORY-260715-lkshfz_ssh-engine-spike/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2mqgvm_viability-and-foundation/progress.md\\n M .task-board/EPIC-260715-2qzczm_resilience-and-performance/STORY-260715-1zzt0c_windows-rekey-and-memory-co