{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c4a3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa46-d728-77c2-9a0a-18bc71689023"},"sequence":172,"recorded_at":1780531400000339,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b453ccc3-4f00-4f8b-a373-9035c9afcdba"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa47-6b2e-79d0-83c1-433dd48bf8f8"},"task_id":"01a0aa47-6b2e-79d0-83c1-433dd48bf8f8","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa47-6b2e-79d0-83c1-433dd48bf8f8","chunk":"Read text file `.task-board/.resources/BUG-260916-1rqn1c/BUG-260916-1rqn1c_results-rev3.md`.\n1|# BUG-260916-1rqn1c rev3: rework of the two review-rev2 findings\n2|\n3|Only `review-verdict-rev2.md` findings 1 and 2 are addressed. Diagnosis,\n4|official toolchain evidence, runner choice (`macos-26` + explicit `17F42`\n5|selection), and the rev1/rev2 outcomes are unchanged and not repeated here.\n6|\n7|## Finding 1 — selector substring attestation (fixed)\n8|\n9|`scripts/select-native-xcode.sh` matched `*\"Build version $expected_build\"*`,\n10|so `Build version 17F420` was falsely attested as `17F42`. Reproduced pre-fix\n11|via the existing PATH-shim harness: exit 0,\n12|`using .../Xcode_26.5.app (Build version 17F42)`.\n13|\n14|Fix: extract the complete token after the trailing `^Build version ` line and\n15|compare exactly (`[ \"$actual_build\" != \"$expected_build\" ]`). Post-fix the\n16|same probe exits 1 with the unchanged `mismatch` message. The legacy\n17|`libssh2-fork-tool.py verify_xcode_build` substring behavior is pre-existing\n18|and untouched (outside this slice per brief).\n19|\n20|New named negative: `test_selection_rejects_build_with_pin_as_prefix`\n21|(production call site: `scripts/select-native-xcode.sh` verification gate).\n22|New suffix-only narrowing mutant `admit-suffix-build-only` (gate kept,\n23|additionally admits exactly `17F420`), killed by that named test (exit 1).\n24|\n25|## Finding 2 — source-text-only workflow guard (fixed)\n26|\n27|`test_workflow_selects_pinned_xcode_before_gate` only greps the workflow.\n28|Reproduced pre-fix: `run: echo sh ./scripts/select-native-xcode.sh` in the\n29|copied workflow (token preserved, execution disabled) still exits 0 over the\n30|full 12-test suite.\n31|\n32|Fix: new test `test_workflow_selection_command_executes_and_selects_pin`\n33|extracts the exact `run:` command of the selection step from the\n34|credential-free job (asserts exactly one invocation), executes it with the\n35|same PATH shims, and proves selection effects (exit 0, recorded path is the\n36|pinned `Contents/Developer`, `(Build version 17F42)` reported). Post-fix the\n37|reviewer's echo-bypass fails the suite (exit 1, exactly that test; the static\n38|guard still passes, proving the token is preserved). Shared fixture setup was\n39|factored into `selection_fixture`; all pre-existing behavioral tests run\n40|through it unchanged. The static ordering test is kept.\n41|\n42|New token-preserving mutant `workflow-selection-echo-preserves-token`\n43|(target `.github/workflows/ci.yml`), killed by the full 14-test behavioral\n44|suite. Plus narrowing mutants for the three refusal gates the reviewer called\n45|out (each gate kept, admits exactly one member):\n46|- `admit-one-disagreeing-pin-pair` (admits 17F42/17C529) -> killed by\n47|  `test_selection_refuses_disagreeing_manifest_pins`\n48|- `admit-one-unmapped-build` (admits 17C529 via the staged decoy app, so the\n49|  kill proves mapping-gate admission, not the install gate) -> killed by\n50|  `test_selection_refuses_unmapped_build`\n51|- `admit-one-missing-install` (admits missing Xcode_26.5.app) -> killed by\n52|  `test_selection_refuses_missing_install`\n53|Existing `admit-macos26-default-only` was re-anchored to the rewritten gate\n54|(admits exactly 17F113); still killed by its named test. The harness is now\n55|target-aware (script or workflow per mutant).\n56|\n57|## Identities (vs PR6 head d45c85d, non-board)\n58|\n59|- HEAD unmoved at `b3422b05226253a17676b9b84c764071fe3dbe74`; nothing committed.\n60|- Overlay: 59/59 staged entries byte-equal to PR6 blobs (checked=59 mismatch=0).\n61|- Unchanged from rev2: ci.yml `205b10013422af7e43ead2a0fcd1b20ac627a4eb`,\n62|  contract `0163045f360692a9940938d7e34b4f376cf5df03`.\n63|- New bytes: select-native-xcode.sh\n64|  `0575eaddec932b6f100ca5e60431a30061ce324f` (100755),\n65|  alignment `22d2c1edfac56a717b67c2220c1548c568139fdc`,\n66|  mutants `0d67c482239e0b52db1f50168bdfb04aee07ee76`.\n67|- Prospective PR composition: PR6 head + these 5 paths (modes included) =\n68|  tree `008148dc2967e563f973234d3e944f51b120f456`; prospective diff is exactly\n69|  the 5 paths (496 insertions, 3 deletions). Layout: staged = prerequisite\n70|  overlay; unstaged = ci.yml + contract deltas; untracked = selector + 2 tests.\n71|- `NativeDependencies/manifest.json` identical across HEAD/index/worktree/PR6\n72|  (`31e39df3...`); no manifest/artifact/product/deployment-target change.\n73|\n74|## Validation (exact exit codes, no tail masking)\n75|\n76|- Pre-fix probes: 17F420 -> script exit 0 (false accept); echo-bypass ->\n77|  suite exit 0, 12 OK (blind). Both authentic failures observed before editing.\n78|- `python3 scripts/tests/test_native_toolchain_alignment.py`: exit 0, 14 OK.\n79|- `python3 scripts/tests/test_native_toolchain_mutants.py`: exit 0; baseline\n80|  exit 0; all 7 narrowing mutants killed (2 re-anchored/pre-existing + 5 new),\n81|  each by its documented test; token-preserving mutants run the full suite.\n82|- `sh scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh`: exit 0 (scheme\n83|  fixtures, macos-26/mise/arm64/gate assertions, provider-graph guard, macos\n84|  diagnostics + 3 mutants, native alignment 14/14 + 7 mutants, pass banner).\n85|- `sh -n` on the selector clean; `git diff --check` clean.\n86|- No linter configured (no Makefile lint target, no hidden linter configs).\n87|- Not rerun: full `make credential-free-validate` and `check-native-dependencies`\n88|  (owned by the handoff automatic CR gate; their paths are untouched since the\n89|  rev2 green, and the brief forbids redundant exhaustive runs).\n90|\n91|## AC coverage: 2 of 6 rows driven by executable tests (corrected per reviewer)\n92|\n93|Production call sites: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\n94|(`generated-project-credential-free` selection step) ->\n95|`scripts/select-native-xcode.sh` -> shimmed `xcode-select`/`xcodebuild`;\n96|contract entry `scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh` (wired via\n97|`Makefile credential-free-validate` -> `scripts/validate-credential-free.sh`).\n98|\n99|1. Narrow reproducible fix -- DRIVEN: exact-match selector + executable\n100|   workflow-command test, 14/14 green through the production gate lane.\n101|2. Independent review -- STATED BOUND: reviewer stage.\n102|3. Exact prospective PR composition identity -- STATED BOUND: manual identity\n103|   computation above, not an executable test (corrected from rev2).\n104|4. Targeted validation -- DRIVEN: contract lane exit 0 incl. 7-mutant harness.\n105|5. Honest hosted validation requirements -- STATED BOUND: this outcome + rev1,\n106|   rev2, toolchain-evidence prose (corrected from rev2).\n107|6. Real hosted publication/landing -- STATED BOUND: parent delivery duty.\n108|\n109|Negative/narrowing evidence: 16F6, 17F113, and 17F420 rejections (exit 1 +\n110|`mismatch`); disagreeing/unmapped/missing-pin and missing-install refusals\n111|(exit 2); 7 narrowing mutants each killed by a named/full behavioral suite\n112|through the production entry points above.\n113|\n114|## Bounds\n115|\n116|- Hosted proof still requires publishing the prospective PR (parent duty).\n117|- No global xcode-select change: every selector execution in this run used\n118|  PATH shims (sudo intercepted