rify for Ivan Oparin <oparin@me.com>. Original signed Story checkpoint 9bf4d0892db03035b989a4c040cfee37636ff8df is preserved.\\n\\nValidation: accepted rev3 independent review reran runtime harness, 11 focused Swift tests, scheme-contract negative tests and a killed narrowed-gate mutant. Same-tree full credential-free publisher and independent suites passed; 514 Swift tests and selected-scope 90.32% line coverage are recorded in attached board evidence. Delivery independently verified signed objects, exact accepted product tree, board-only second delta and clean product diff whitespace. Historical raw evidence logs contain whitespace diagnostics; they were preserved verbatim. Hosted checks and exact-head platform review remain required before remote main advances.\\n\\n==PR commits==\\n6e8a198 STORY-260715-1y04r0: Shared tunnel runtime and extension-owned orches…\\n87451b5 Record STORY-260715-1y04r0 board state\\n018c9d9 fix(ci): compose accepted validation boundaries and macOS diagnostics\\na46e2ba fix(runtime): require Sendable mapped result for Swift 6.1\\n310a560 fix(macos): guard NWError.wifiAware mapping for older SDKs\\nd45c85d fix(harness): declare M1 host-owner probe as weak var\\n==local feature log==\\nd45c85d Good \\\"git\\\" signature for oparin@me.com with ECDSA key SHA256:V6JiKG7J29mjsvikcLoSVp0bLa77VTsFy12gnLO81cM\\nfix(harness): declare M1 host-owner probe as weak var\\n310a560 Good \\\"git\\\" signature for oparin@me.com with ECDSA key SHA256:V6JiKG7J29mjsvikcLoSVp0bLa77VTsFy12gnLO81cM\\nfix(macos): guard NWError.wifiAware mapping for older SDKs\\na46e2ba Good \\\"git\\\" signature for oparin@me.com with ECDSA key SHA256:V6JiKG7J29mjsvikcLoSVp0bLa77VTsFy12gnLO81cM\\nfix(runtime): require Sendable mapped result for Swift 6.1\\n018c9d9 Good \\\"git\\\" signature for oparin@me.com with ECDSA key SHA256:V6JiKG7J29mjsvikcLoSVp0bLa77VTsFy12gnLO81cM\\nfix(ci): compose accepted validation boundaries and macOS diagnostics\\n87451b5 Good \\\"git\\\" signatur